## JCL in Real-World Scenarios

### Theory: Why Mainframe Batch Processing?

**Characteristics of Mainframe Environments:**

```
1. VOLUME & SCALE
   ├─ Process millions of records
   ├─ Handle terabytes of data
   ├─ 24/7 availability required
   └─ Cost-effective at scale

2. RELIABILITY
   ├─ 99.99% uptime SLA
   ├─ Built-in redundancy
   ├─ Disaster recovery
   └─ Transaction safety

3. SECURITY
   ├─ Advanced access control
   ├─ Encryption capabilities
   ├─ Audit trails
   └─ Compliance features

4. BATCH PROCESSING
   ├─ Off-peak processing
   ├─ Scheduled jobs
   ├─ Bulk data operations
   └─ Report generation
```

**JCL's Role:**

```
JCL orchestrates:
├─ Program execution
├─ Data movement
├─ Resource allocation
├─ Job dependencies
├─ Error handling
└─ Job scheduling
```

