//

Theory Behind This Job:
─────────────────────────

1. SEQUENTIAL PROCESSING
   ├─ Each step depends on previous
   ├─ Data flows through pipeline
   ├─ COND controls dependencies
   └─ Ensures data integrity

2. DATA ORGANIZATION
   ├─ Transactions collected
   ├─ Sorted by account (for efficiency)
   ├─ Posted to master records
   └─ Then analyzed and reported

3. ERROR HANDLING
   ├─ COND=(0,NE,STEP) skips if success
   ├─ Prevents cascading failures
   ├─ Critical for financial accuracy
   └─ Each step validated

4. RESOURCE MANAGEMENT
   ├─ REGION sized for each step
   ├─ TIME limits realistic
   ├─ SPACE allocated adequately
   └─ Temporary datasets deleted

5. AUDIT TRAIL
   ├─ All steps logged (SYSOUT)
   ├─ Backup created
   ├─ Discrepancies reported
   └─ Compliance maintained
```

