  ├─ Validate hours
  └─ Approve payroll

Week 2: Calculation
  ├─ Calculate gross pay
  ├─ Deduct taxes
  ├─ Generate checks
  └─ Post to GL

Week 3: Distribution
  ├─ Print checks
  ├─ Deposit to accounts
  ├─ Update employee records
  └─ File reports
```

