## Error Recovery & Restart

### Theory: Fault Tolerance

**Recovery Strategies:**

```
1. CONDITIONAL EXECUTION
   ├─ COND skips failed steps
   ├─ Prevents cascading failures
   ├─ Each step validates input
   └─ Alternative processing paths

2. RESTART CAPABILITY
   ├─ RESTART=STEPNAME
   ├─ Resume from failure point
   ├─ Skip successful steps
   └─ Saves processing time

3. MANUAL INTERVENTION
   ├─ Error notification
   ├─ Operator investigation
   ├─ Fix root cause
   └─ Resubmit

4. ALTERNATIVE LOGIC
   ├─ Use different program path
   ├─ Lower data quality acceptable
   ├─ Meet time requirements
   └─ Better than failure
```

