**Performance Considerations:**

```
POLLING OVERHEAD:
├─ 10-second interval
├─ Average 6 requests/minute per user
├─ 1000 users = 6000 requests/min
├─ Server must handle efficiently

OPTIMIZATION STRATEGIES:
├─ Increase interval (15-30 seconds for less critical)
├─ Use ETag for conditional requests
├─ Cache results briefly
├─ Implement exponential backoff
└─ Switch to WebSocket for high-frequency

ETag Example:
  Request 1: GET /api/notifications
  Response: ETag: "abc123"
  
  Request 2: GET /api/notifications
  If-None-Match: "abc123"
  Response: 304 Not Modified (no body sent)
```

